# ripgrep/-aware search ignore (affects Grep/Glob; does NOT affect git).
# Keeps content searches off generated code and non-source data so agents
# don't burn context traversing gigabytes of binaries or 22k-line GL bindings.
# See arma_CWR/CLAUDE.md "Working map" for the rationale.

# Generated OpenGL bindings (~22k lines across 2 files)
arma_CWR/thirdparty/glad/

# Third-party mod test data (2.2G, binary PBOs/textures) — read-only reference
/@LoBo/

# Build output
arma_CWR/build/

# Installed base game data (also in .gitignore; belt-and-suspenders for search).
# Brackets are glob character-classes here too, so escape them.
/ARMA Cold War Assault \[Classic\]/
/Arma Cold War Assault Demo \[Remaster\]/
